  {
   "_id": 50079,
   "ANSWER": "<table><tr><th>Step</th><th>Marks</th></tr><tr><td>Sine series: \\(\\cos x=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}b_n\\sin nx\\)</td><td>(1)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(b_n=\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^{\\pi}\\cos x\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{2n}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{1+(-1)^n}{1-n^2}\\) for \\(n\\neq1\\)</td><td>(4)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(b_1=0\\)</td><td>(2)</td></tr><tr><td>Thus, \\(\\cos x=\\frac{8}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{4n^2-1}\\sin 2nx\\)</td><td>(4)</td></tr><tr><td>Verification at \\(x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\)</td><td>(4)</td></tr></table>",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21MAB201T",
